  "title": "Time Machine is a Playful Greenhouse Cannabis Brand for Adventurous Spirits",
  "summary": "Time Machine is a California cannabis brand founded in 2022 by the team behind Pacific Stone, greenhouse-grown in Carpinteria with a lineup built around smooth smoke, bold flavor, and a playful concept rooted in cannabis's long history. Their 28pk Fuel-Rod Pre-Roll was a first-to-market format that others followed. Their flower pouches keep climbing. This summer, their infused smalls line returns in a new format: a 14g THCa-infused pouch.",
